<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <Version>1.1.0</Version>
    <PackageId>TokenGuard.Core</PackageId>
    <Title>TokenGuard.Core</Title>
    <Authors>Svetlozar Stoykov</Authors>
    <Company>Svetlozar Stoykov</Company>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) 2026 Svetlozar Stoykov</Copyright>
    <Description>Token budget management for .NET 10 LLM agent loops. Tracks conversation growth, masks stale tool output, summarizes older history when needed, and keeps requests within a configured limit.</Description>
    <PackageTags>tokenguard;llm;ai;agents;context-management;token-budget;prompt-management;openai;anthropic;dotnet</PackageTags>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/svetstoykov/TokenGuard</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/svetstoykov/TokenGuard</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>Adds optional logging, tracing, metrics, and conversation health signals: ConversationConfigBuilder.WithLoggerFactory(ILoggerFactory), plus an ActivitySource and a Meter named TokenGuard. Fixes pinned-message placement, tool-loop compaction, turn grouping, and option validation.

Behavior changes, with no signature changes: PrepareResult.TokensAfterCompaction includes the provider correction and can turn a Ready or Compacted result into CompactionInsufficient or CannotCompact; Build() rejects NaN thresholds and default-constructed option structs; prepared views place pinned messages relative to their neighbours, keep the user message that opened a tool loop, and group turns by message structure.

Known limits: the token counter, summarizer, summary formatter, and builder registration of a custom compaction strategy are closed to consumers; one ConversationContext is for one caller at a time; token estimates leave out request overhead such as tool schemas; the package targets net10.0 only.

Full details: https://github.com/svetstoykov/TokenGuard/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md</PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions" Version="10.0.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions" Version="10.0.0" />
  </ItemGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
        <InternalsVisibleTo Include="TokenGuard.Tests" />
        <InternalsVisibleTo Include="TokenGuard.IntegrationTests" />
        <InternalsVisibleTo Include="TokenGuard.Samples.Console" />
        <InternalsVisibleTo Include="TokenGuard.Benchmark" />
        <InternalsVisibleTo Include="TokenGuard.Extensions.OpenAI" />
        <InternalsVisibleTo Include="TokenGuard.Extensions.Anthropic" />
        <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Codexplorer" />
    </ItemGroup>

</Project>
